  171|       |            // https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf#concretesym but fixed to
  172|       |            // 80 bytes in https://zips.z.cash/protocol/protocol.pdf#outputencodingandconsensus
  173|       |            // See [`note::WrappedNoteKey::zcash_deserialize`].
